msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"As mentioned in previous blog posts, we encourage all our community users to "
"upgrade to Quarkus 3.\n"
"Most of the heavy lifting can be done with https://quarkus.io/guides/update-"
"quarkus[`quarkus update`]\n"
"but be aware that some components were updated to new major versions\n"
"and that migrating might require some time and careful testing if you are "
"using these components."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We will continue to maintain 2.16.x until the end of October so we recommend "
"that you start your migration process very soon.\n"
"Today, we released Quarkus 2.16.12.Final, the twelfth maintenance release of "
"our 2.16 release train."
msgstr ""

msgid "This release fixes several CVEs:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-44487[CVE-2023-44487] for Netty"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-39410[CVE-2023-39410] for Apache "
"Avro"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-34454[CVE-2023-34454] for Snappy"
msgstr ""

msgid "It should be a safe upgrade for anyone already using 2.16."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are not already using 2.16, please refer to https://github.com/"
"quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-2.16[our migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/2.16.12."
"Final[the full changelog of 2.16.12.Final on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... "
"Let's build something great together!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our "
"welcoming community:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https:/"
"/groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/"
"quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr ""
